> This criminal illegal alien committed a felony by voting in federal elections dating back to 2008. Illegal aliens should NOT be electing American leaders,

said Deputy Assistant Secretary Lauren Bis.

> Our elections belong to American citizens, not foreign citizens. Congress must pass the SAVE America Act immediately to secure our elections.

DHS is dedicated to preserving and protecting the integrity of American elections as fair and honest elections, unmarred by fraud, errors, or suspicion as fundamental to maintaining our constitutional republic.

